          "fontSize": 11.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "OFTV3",
          "name": "Parallel Retry Note",
          "fill": "#777777",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "并行调用按 assistant ordinal 固定顺序；retry 只更新同一行，不新增行、不重复计数。",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Geist",
          "fontSize": 11.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ZNibp",
          "name": "Final Boundary Note",
          "fill": "#777777",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "未解析 Agent 正文从首 delta 即以正文 Markdown 展示；有既有 detail 时它按 part 顺序进入 Trace，无 detail 时才在标题下；仅 commentary、Tool、Skill、Resource、Prompt 或来源构成折叠详情。",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Geist",
          "fontSize": 11.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cDo5k",
          "name": "Terminal Note",
          "fill": "#777777",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "agent-text-end 解析为 final_answer 后才显示“已完成思考”并自动收起；取消为“已停止思考”；constrained 为“处理未完成”且 live 默认展开。",
